    /// * [`Error::InvalidReceiver`] - interface id or returned with error.
    /// * [`Error::InvalidReceiver`] - If
    ///   [`IErc1155Receiver::on_erc1155_batch_received`] hasn't returned its
    ///   interface id or returned with error.
